	Silas: "But I don't know if we have to worry about that. From what I've heard, this thing is like an urban legend, and people have said it only shows up when you're alone."
- "Why would it come here?"
	Player: "Why would it come here? Didn't it only show up when he was alone?"
	Silas: "You're probably right. From what I've heard, this thing is like an urban legend, and people have said it only shows up when you're alone."
[i]A slightly uncomfortable silence falls between the two of you. {Silas.name} rubs his eyes.[/i]
